What:		/config/usb-gadget/gadget/functions/blk.name
Date:		Oct 2026
KernelVersion:	7.3
Description:
		The attributes:

		===========	=============================================
		timeout		seconds to wait for the USB host to complete
				a request or to attach again after a
				disconnect before requests fail, 0 to wait
				forever (default 30)
		queue_depth	maximum number of outstanding requests
				(default 32)
		max_xfer	maximum size of a read or write request in
				bytes, a multiple of 4096 (default 131072)
		qlen		number of requests that can be queued for
				transmission to the host at once (default 8)
		disk		(read only) name of the block device, empty if
				the host has not attached a disk
		===========	=============================================

		queue_depth, max_xfer and qlen can only be changed while
		the function is not linked to a configuration and no disk
		exists.

